{"page":297,"verses":[{"verse_key":"18:28","surah":18,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱصْبِرْ نَفْسَكَ مَعَ ٱلَّذِينَ يَدْعُونَ رَبَّهُم بِٱلْغَدَوٰةِ وَٱلْعَشِىِّ يُرِيدُونَ وَجْهَهُۥ ۖ وَلَا تَعْدُ عَيْنَاكَ عَنْهُمْ تُرِيدُ زِينَةَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ وَلَا تُطِعْ مَنْ أَغْفَلْنَا قَلْبَهُۥ عَن ذِكْرِنَا وَٱتَّبَعَ هَوَىٰهُ وَكَانَ أَمْرُهُۥ فُرُطًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Content yourself with those who pray to their Lord morning and evening, seeking His approval, and do not let your eyes turn away from them out of desire for the attractions of this worldly life: do not yield to those whose hearts We have made heedless of Our Quran, those who follow their own low desires, those whose ways are unbridled.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱصْبِرْ","en_gloss":"And be patient","transliteration":"wa-iṣ'bir","verse_key":"18:28"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَفْسَكَ","en_gloss":"yourself","transliteration":"nafsaka","verse_key":"18:28"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَعَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"maʿa","verse_key":"18:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"18:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"call","transliteration":"yadʿūna","verse_key":"18:28"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَبَّهُم","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbahum","verse_key":"18:28"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱلْغَدَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"in the morning","transliteration":"bil-ghadati","verse_key":"18:28"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلْعَشِىِّ","en_gloss":"and the evening","transliteration":"wal-ʿashiyi","verse_key":"18:28"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُرِيدُونَ","en_gloss":"desiring","transliteration":"yurīdūna","verse_key":"18:28"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَجْهَهُۥ ۖ","en_gloss":"His Face","transliteration":"wajhahu","verse_key":"18:28"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (let) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"18:28"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَعْدُ","en_gloss":"pass beyond","transliteration":"taʿdu","verse_key":"18:28"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَيْنَاكَ","en_gloss":"your eyes","transliteration":"ʿaynāka"